      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>\n> What really held my attention was the implication of Ivanka and Felicia? c.c Like... what? Since when?\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is presumably a new, exciting universe. There is no Ivana Ramonat in the Sentinel Comics timeline, and to my recollection there is no Felicia Parsons in the Inversiverse, so they wouldn't have had the opportunity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Not much to say about this fight - Heroic Luminary is just&nbsp;<em>unfair</em>&nbsp;against Ambuscade. I deliberately left most of Ambuscade's devices around to charge her main Power, and she was unleashing ludicrous amounts of damage each turn. The only person who ended below 20 HP was Setback, and that was only because I let everyone punch him in the face to charge his tokens.&nbsp;</p>",
